: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※ </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">예약 후 탑승 불가할 시 반드시 취소 처리</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"8517\"></div><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"6304\"></div><pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; overflow: auto; text-wrap: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: collapse; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -34.3pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">노쇼 방지</span><span style=\"text-indent: -34.3pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">를 위한 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -34.3pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">QR</span><span style=\"text-indent: -34.3pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">태그 도입</span><span style=\"text-indent: -34.3pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">에 따라 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -34.3pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">예약 좌석 착석 후 비치된 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -34.3pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">QR</span><span style=\"text-indent: -34.3pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">코드 태그</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -34.3pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -34.3pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">태그 누락 시 노쇼 간주되므로 유의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -34.3pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><br></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"9392\"></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; white-space-collapse: collapse;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">노쇼 횟수별 탑승 제재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 1</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">회&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">주일&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">/ 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">회&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">개월&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">/ 3</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">회&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">개월</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; white-space-collapse: collapse;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">개인 간 승차권 매매 또는 양도 절대 불가: 매매 또는 양도 대상이 아니며, 적발 시 양측 모두 영구 탑승 불가 처리</span></span><br></div><pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-wrap: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 0.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"white-space-collapse: collapse; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">탑승자 유의사항</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; white-space-collapse: collapse;\"><span